desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Detected SSH Password"
	title_zh: "检测到Detected SSH Password",
	type: vuln
	level: critical
	rule_id: "source-secrets-detected-ssh-password"
	risk: "hardcoded-password"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
SSH Password detected

### 风险类型
硬编码密码（hardcoded-password）

### 影响
代码中直接写入密码，攻击者可通过源码泄露获得系统访问权限。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-798: Use of Hard-coded Credentials
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用密码管理服务或环境变量保存密码，避免在源码和配置文件中出现明文密码。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.sample": <<<POS
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-secrets-detected-ssh-password
POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*}.pattern_regex(/(?:sshpass -p\s*['|\\\"][^%])|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-secrets\-detected\-ssh\-password/) as $p0
$p0 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "Detected SSH Password",
	title_zh: "检测到Detected SSH Password",
	message: "Detected SSH Password",
}
